msgid "Realtek PCIe 以太网驱动"
msgstr "Realtek PCIe Ethernet driver"

msgid "设备与配置"
msgstr "Devices and configuration"

msgid ""
"``drivers/net/r8169/`` 提供 ReliefNT 原生网卡驱动。``CONFIG_R8169`` 为 tristate，``make"
" defconfig`` 默认选择 ``y``。选择 ``m`` 生成 ``drivers/net/r8169/r8169.ko``，由普通 "
"``modprobe`` 根据 PCI 别名加载。"
msgstr ""
"``drivers/net/r8169/`` provides a native ReliefNT network driver. "
"``CONFIG_R8169`` is tristate, and ``make defconfig`` selects ``y`` by "
"default. Selecting ``m`` generates ``drivers/net/r8169/r8169.ko``, loaded by"
" ordinary ``modprobe`` using PCI aliases."

msgid ""
"设备表包含 ``10ec:8168`` 和 ``10ec:8125``。驱动进一步读取 TxConfig 中的硬件版本，分别选择初始化、PHY "
"和固件流程。"
msgstr ""
"The device table includes ``10ec:8168`` and ``10ec:8125``. The driver also "
"reads the hardware revision in TxConfig to select the respective "
"initialization, PHY, and firmware procedures."

msgid "已实现的芯片版本路径"
msgstr "Implemented chip-revision paths"

msgid "PCI ID"
msgstr "PCI ID"

msgid "MAC 版本"
msgstr "MAC revision"

msgid "``10ec:8168``"
msgstr "``10ec:8168``"

msgid ""
"RTL8111/8168 B、C、CP、D、DP、E、E-VL、F、G、GU、H、EP、FP。 按 OpenBSD 的版本掩码区分家族与 B/C 的 "
"spin。"
msgstr ""
"RTL8111/8168 B, C, CP, D, DP, E, E-VL, F, G, GU, H, EP, and FP. OpenBSD "
"revision masks distinguish families and B/C spins."

msgid "``10ec:8125``"
msgstr "``10ec:8125``"

msgid ""
"RTL8125A ``0x60900000``、B ``0x64100000``、D-1 ``0x68800000``、 D-2 "
"``0x68900000``。"
msgstr ""
"RTL8125A ``0x60900000``, B ``0x64100000``, D-1 ``0x68800000``, D-2 "
"``0x68900000``."

msgid ""
"未知 MAC 家族返回 ``-ENODEV``。驱动枚举全部匹配的 PCI 功能，为每张网卡 分配独立 DMA 环和上下文，通过私有 "
"``driver_register_netdev`` 注册 ``eth0``、``eth1`` 等接口。网络用户程序使用 Linux "
"socket、ioctl、netlink 和 proc 接口。接口生命周期和多网卡选路见 :doc:`network-devices`。"
msgstr ""
"Unknown MAC families return ``-ENODEV``. The driver enumerates all matching "
"PCI functions, allocates independent DMA rings and contexts for each "
"adapter, and registers interfaces such as ``eth0`` and ``eth1`` through the "
"private ``driver_register_netdev``. Network user programs use Linux socket, "
"ioctl, netlink, and proc interfaces. See :doc:`network-devices` for "
"interface lifecycles and routing across multiple adapters."

msgid ""
"无网线时接口仍可查询和配置，载波状态来自硬件。PHY 自动协商覆盖 10/100/1000 Mb/s，RTL8125 另行通告 2500BASE-T "
"全双工。协商异步完成。 PHY、EPHY、CSI、固件握手和复位均有界等待，失败返回具体 errno。"
msgstr ""
"Interfaces remain queryable and configurable without a cable, and carrier "
"state comes from hardware. PHY autonegotiation covers 10/100/1000 Mb/s, with"
" RTL8125 additionally advertising 2500BASE-T full duplex. Negotiation "
"completes asynchronously. PHY, EPHY, CSI, firmware handshakes, and reset all"
" use bounded waits and return specific errno values on failure."

msgid ""
"硬件初始化中的微秒级稳定等待使用启动时间采样；短于 1 ms 的等待最多 轮询 4096 次，且采样期间关闭本地中断以避免 CPU "
"迁移。时钟停滞、回退或 达到轮询上限时改用 tick 等待；较长等待也使用 tick 等待，并额外加入一整个 tick，以覆盖请求恰好接近下一个 "
"tick 的情况。等待返回后恢复原中断状态， 调用方不得持有自旋锁。短等待依赖内核启动时钟的精度；该时钟突然向前跳变 可能缩短等待。"
msgstr ""
"Microsecond stabilization waits during hardware initialization use boot-time"
" clock samples. Waits shorter than 1 ms poll at most 4096 times, with local "
"interrupts disabled during sampling to avoid CPU migration. If the clock "
"stalls, moves backward, or the poll limit is reached, waiting switches to "
"ticks. Longer waits also use ticks and add one full tick to cover requests "
"made just before the next tick. The original interrupt state is restored on "
"return; callers must not hold spinlocks. Short waits depend on the accuracy "
"of the kernel boot clock; a sudden forward jump can shorten a wait."

msgid "收发和生命周期"
msgstr "Transmit/receive and lifecycle"

msgid ""
"驱动优先映射 PCI BAR2，再尝试其他有效内存 BAR，支持 64 位地址。 PCI 电源管理使用常规 capability 链请求 D0。原始 "
"MAC 在复位前读取并保留， 无效地址导致初始化失败。 早期 RTL8168 的控制 BAR 可能只有 256 字节，此时可通过该设备的 I/O BAR"
" 访问同一寄存器组。PCI 内存映射仍要求完整页面位于有效 BAR 内。"
msgstr ""
"The driver first tries to map PCI BAR2, then other valid memory BARs, "
"supporting 64-bit addresses. PCI power management requests D0 through the "
"standard capability chain. The original MAC is read and retained before "
"reset; an invalid address fails initialization. Early RTL8168 control BARs "
"may be only 256 bytes, in which case the device's I/O BAR can access the "
"same register set. PCI memory mappings still require a complete page within "
"a valid BAR."

msgid ""
"RX/TX 各使用 256 个 16 字节经典描述符和 2048 字节缓冲区。RTL8125 显式选择经典布局。描述符保留物理 DMA 地址，CPU "
"通过独立映射访问数据。 所有权交接使用 acquire/release 屏障，发送与接收有独立的短临界区。 当前使用单队列轮询，MTU 为 "
"1500，IP/传输层校验和由现有网络栈计算。"
msgstr ""
"RX and TX each use 256 classic 16-byte descriptors and 2048-byte buffers. "
"RTL8125 explicitly selects the classic layout. Descriptors retain physical "
"DMA addresses, while the CPU accesses data through separate mappings. "
"Ownership handoff uses acquire/release barriers, with separate short "
"critical sections for transmit and receive. The current implementation uses "
"single-queue polling with an MTU of 1500, and the existing network stack "
"computes IP/transport checksums."

msgid ""
"发送帧补零到最小 Ethernet 长度，再由硬件附加 FCS。队列满返回 ``-EAGAIN``。接收检查错误、缓冲区与调用者容量，移除一个 "
"FCS，并完整 丢弃跨描述符的异常分片链。接收过滤器接受本站单播、广播和多播，供 IPv4 ARP、DHCP 与 IPv6 邻居发现使用。"
msgstr ""
"Transmit frames are zero-padded to the minimum Ethernet length before "
"hardware appends the FCS. A full queue returns ``-EAGAIN``. Receive checks "
"errors, buffer capacity, and caller capacity, removes one FCS, and drops "
"abnormal fragment chains spanning descriptors in full. Receive filters "
"accept local unicast, broadcast, and multicast for IPv4 ARP, DHCP, and IPv6 "
"neighbor discovery."

msgid ""
"初始化先禁用 PCI bus master 并确认控制器复位，再分配和发布 DMA 队列。 卸载由模块 owner "
"关闭回调准入、排空在途调用，随后停止收发和复位。 停止失败时保留 DMA、MMIO 和模块代码以供重试。释放内存后 PCI bus master "
"保持关闭。"
msgstr ""
"Initialization first disables PCI bus mastering and confirms controller "
"reset, then allocates and publishes DMA queues. During unloading, the module"
" owner closes callback admission and drains in-flight calls before stopping "
"transmit/receive and resetting. A stop failure retains DMA, MMIO, and module"
" code for retry. PCI bus mastering remains disabled after memory is freed."

msgid "固件和许可"
msgstr "Firmware and licensing"

msgid ""
"RTL8125 的 MAC/PHY 固件以未经修改的常量寄存器对嵌入内核或模块，启动时 按芯片版本选择。构建消费仓库内数据。运行时无需网络下载。 "
"固件在完成写入与握手后才更新版本标记，并回读确认。"
msgstr ""
"RTL8125 MAC/PHY firmware is embedded in the kernel or module as unmodified "
"constant register pairs and selected by chip revision at startup. The build "
"consumes data in the repository; no network download is required at runtime."
" Firmware version markers are updated only after writing and handshaking "
"complete, then read back for confirmation."

msgid ""
"硬件初始化改编自 OpenBSD src 提交 ``7779d12194498048b288afda664dd6271a2ec016``。 "
"RTL8111/8168 派生代码保留 BSD-4-Clause，RTL8125 派生代码保留 ISC， 固件保留 Realtek "
"的再分发许可。项目新增的 PCI/DMA/模块连接代码使用 Apache-2.0。完整声明见 ``NOTICE`` 和 "
"``LICENSES/realtek/``。 ``modules_install`` 将声明放入版本化模块目录的 ``LICENSES/``，连同 "
"模块加入安装所有权和校验清单，并随 ReliefOS 的内核载荷分发。"
msgstr ""
"Hardware initialization is adapted from OpenBSD src commit "
"``7779d12194498048b288afda664dd6271a2ec016``. RTL8111/8168-derived code "
"retains BSD-4-Clause, RTL8125-derived code retains ISC, and firmware retains"
" Realtek's redistribution license. New project PCI/DMA/module integration "
"code uses Apache-2.0. Full notices are in ``NOTICE`` and "
"``LICENSES/realtek/``. ``modules_install`` places the notices in "
"``LICENSES/`` in the versioned module directory, includes them with modules "
"in installation ownership and checksum manifests, and distributes them with "
"the ReliefOS kernel payload."

