msgid "验证范围"
msgstr "Validation coverage"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_r8169.py`` 编译真实驱动对象并模拟 PCI/MMIO/DMA 边界，另行编译 "
"真实寄存器与等待实现，检查时钟边界、中断状态和不同寄存器访问方式。 它覆盖 4 GiB 以上地址、收发回绕、长度与错误检查、补零、无载波、资源分配 "
"失败、owner 冲突、停止失败保留与重试。芯片模型覆盖四个 RTL8125 版本和 RTL8168 家族路径。真实 PHY 协商、DMA "
"时序和实体网线收发仍需对应硬件验证。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_r8169.py`` compiles actual driver objects and models the "
"PCI/MMIO/DMA boundary. It separately compiles the real register and wait "
"implementations to check clock boundaries, interrupt state, and different "
"register access methods. Coverage includes addresses above 4 GiB, "
"transmit/receive wraparound, length and error checks, zero padding, no "
"carrier, resource-allocation failures, owner conflicts, and retention and "
"retry after stop failure. Chip models cover four RTL8125 revisions and "
"RTL8168 family paths. Actual PHY negotiation, DMA timing, and physical cable"
" traffic still require validation on the corresponding hardware."

msgid ""
"本次 QEMU 回归覆盖默认内置启动，以及无匹配 Realtek 硬件时三次 ``r8169.ko`` 加载与卸载。既有 e1000 的 "
"IPv4、IPv6 ping 均通过。 测试使用当前新编译内核和私有 initramfs，BusyBox 来自已有 ReliefOS 构建。"
msgstr ""
"This QEMU regression covers default built-in boot and three load/unload "
"cycles of ``r8169.ko`` without matching Realtek hardware. Existing e1000 "
"IPv4 and IPv6 ping tests both pass. Tests use the newly compiled current "
"kernel and a private initramfs, with BusyBox from an existing ReliefOS "
"build."

msgid ""
"本地 QEMU 只提供 RTL8139 Realtek 模型，真实 RTL8111/8168、RTL8125 需要实体网卡或正确的 PCI "
"直通验证。实体网卡验证未完成。VMware 验证未完成。"
msgstr ""
"Local QEMU provides only the RTL8139 Realtek model; actual RTL8111/8168 and "
"RTL8125 require physical adapters or correct PCI passthrough validation. "
"Physical-adapter validation is incomplete. VMware validation is incomplete."
